* gain_cell_2t_array.lvs_reference.spice -- GENERATED array-level plain-
* element (schematic-equivalent) LVS reference netlist for issue #34's
* 4-row x 4-column shared-tap bitcell array, mechanically
* replicating ../design/gain_cell_2t.spice's two-device subcircuit 4x4
* times with the row/column bus net renaming array_topology.py computes --
* NOT hand-transcribed (see layout/generate_array.sh, which regenerates this
* file every run via `python3 layout/array_topology.py --emit lvs-reference`).
* Device names, connectivity, and W/L are copied unchanged from the source
* two-device netlist; only the SPICE *shape* differs (an M-card device class
* "nfet" instead of an X-card subcircuit call, plus a real .SUBCKT/.ENDS
* wrapper with the row/column bus pins below), mirroring
* layout/gain_cell_2t.lvs_reference.spice's own single-cell precedent and
* the reason documented there (klt lvs requires the plain-element form).
*
* Provenance: sha256 of the source netlist this array replicates from
* (reproduce with: sha256sum ../design/gain_cell_2t.spice).
*   ../design/gain_cell_2t.spice: sha256:1dbe6c519b96d651264ef30c736f62188b1c8728833fdd77ac60a9703e8aa05a
*
* sn_<r>_<c> (each bitcell's internal storage node) is deliberately NOT a
* top-level .SUBCKT pin here either -- matching design/gain_cell_2t.sch's
* and the single-cell layout's own convention (see array_topology.py's
* module docstring "Per-cell internal node").
.SUBCKT gain_cell_2t_array_4x4 wl_0 wl_1 wl_2 wl_3 rwl_0 rwl_1 rwl_2 rwl_3 bl_0 bl_1 bl_2 bl_3 rbl_0 rbl_1 rbl_2 rbl_3
M_WR_0_0 sn_0_0 wl_0 bl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_0_0 rbl_0 sn_0_0 rwl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_0_1 sn_0_1 wl_0 bl_1 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_0_1 rbl_1 sn_0_1 rwl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_0_2 sn_0_2 wl_0 bl_2 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_0_2 rbl_2 sn_0_2 rwl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_0_3 sn_0_3 wl_0 bl_3 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_0_3 rbl_3 sn_0_3 rwl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_1_0 sn_1_0 wl_1 bl_0 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_1_0 rbl_0 sn_1_0 rwl_1 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_1_1 sn_1_1 wl_1 bl_1 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_RD_1_1 rbl_1 sn_1_1 rwl_1 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
M_WR_1_2 sn_1_2 wl_1 bl_2 GND nfet L=0.15U W=0.42U
